WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:04.504
[Crowd cheering]

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:09.092
- [Narrator:] It began like any other Dunk Contest.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.886
Two of the league’s best dunkers,

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:13.513
Aaron Gordon and Derrick Jones Jr.,

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.473
facing off in a battle of wills

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:17.058
that would ultimately be decided

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:19.477
by a fair and impartial panel of judges.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:22.605
Judges who were honest and just.&nbsp;

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.649
But that’s not what happened…

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:27.777
When it comes to the most unforgettable moment of the night,&nbsp;

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:30.405
it wasn’t a dunk from either contestant.&nbsp;

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.365
It wasn’t even a dunk.&nbsp;

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:35.827
It was Dwyane Wade leveling a lukewarm 9.&nbsp;

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.079
To those who know him best,

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:40.415
it was the latest clue in lifelong mystery

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.958
that may never be solved…

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.628
[Dramatic music]

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:55.555
- [Older woman:] You know, I'm not surprised.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.017
I've known Dwyane since he was a little boy.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:02.270
He was never easily impressed.

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:06.232
- [Narrator:] Our investigation delved deep into Wade’s childhood,

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:09.235
where we found a shocking pattern of unimpressed reactions

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.529
to objectively excellent things.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.700
This lack of appreciation continued through his formative years.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:17.577
He found no joy

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.954
even in life’s most beautiful music.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:23.708
- [Candace Parker:] Listen, I love D-Wade like a brother.
[Cat, meowing]

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.669
But he's always been like this.

00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:29.422
One time, I saw him drink a Sprite from McDonald's,

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.424
and he didn't even react.

00:01:32.175 --> 00:01:34.427
Have you ever had a fountain Sprite from McDonald's?

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.970
That s--t hits!

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.348
- [Narrator:] We hired the nation’s top private investigators

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:40.850
to find a possible motive, and to our dismay...

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.727
...nothing was found.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.437
Until this...

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.067
If you look at Wade’s hands, you see...&nbsp;

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:53.446
One, two, three, four, five,

00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:57.700
six, seven, eight, nine fingers.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.162
Dwyane Wade even gives one of the most iconic moments,

00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:03.581
a moment that he himself was a part of.

00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:04.874
A nine.

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:07.502
There were more questions than answers.&nbsp;

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:09.212
How and why

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:11.506
could a legendary three-time NBA champion

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:12.799
behave like this?

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.467
- I said I didn't want to talk about it.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.385
Leave me alone!

00:02:18.012 --> 00:02:19.639
- [Narrator:] On the next episode,

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.891
Blake Griffin responds to the critics who say

00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:24.060
he didn’t really jump over the Kia.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.062
- [Reporter:] What do you have to say to that?

